1. Firmware code (everything under `code/`) — NO EXPLICIT LICENSE
====================================================================

The firmware in `code/` is a reconstruction written for documentation
purposes (see its own header comment and docs/firmware.md); it is not the
original code that ran during the project's demonstration. Authorship and
ownership of this specific reconstructed file have not been confirmed, so no
explicit license is granted for it here. It remains under default copyright
("all rights reserved") until that is clarified. If you are one of the
project authors and want to license this file, update this section once
authorship is settled.

